# This repo stores CRLF in the blobs, matching .editorconfig (end_of_line = crlf).
# `-text` disables git's EOL conversion entirely, so files are stored and checked
# out byte-for-byte. This keeps git from silently rewriting line endings and
# producing whole-file diffs.
#
# It does NOT stop an editor from saving LF. .editorconfig is what tells editors
# to use CRLF -- keep both in agreement.

* -text

# Never normalize or diff binaries as text.
*.dll binary
*.so  binary
*.pdb binary
